{
  "about": "Pool and CPU figures for the runs perf/mixed/spike/README.md cites, read from the local Prometheus (2s scrape) on 2026-10-04, because it keeps 15 days. Each value is a query below evaluated at the end of its phase over that phase's length.",
  "caveats": [
    "acquire_max_seconds is Micrometer's decaying max, so a phase can carry an earlier peak: the baselines of rounds 2 and 3 show the previous round's surge.",
    "The pool figures cover reads and writes together: Hikari does not tell them apart.",
    "host_cpu_share includes everything on the rig, k6 and Postgres among it."
  ],
  "queries": {
    "pending_max": "max_over_time(hikaricp_connections_pending[$window])",
    "active_avg": "avg_over_time(hikaricp_connections_active[$window])",
    "acquire_mean_seconds": "increase(hikaricp_connections_acquire_seconds_sum[$window]) / increase(hikaricp_connections_acquire_seconds_count[$window])",
    "acquire_max_seconds": "max_over_time(hikaricp_connections_acquire_seconds_max[$window])",
    "connections_handed_out": "increase(hikaricp_connections_acquire_seconds_count[$window])",
    "hold_mean_seconds": "increase(hikaricp_connections_usage_seconds_sum[$window]) / increase(hikaricp_connections_usage_seconds_count[$window])",
    "app_cpu_share": "avg_over_time(process_cpu_usage[$window])",
    "host_cpu_share": "avg_over_time(system_cpu_usage[$window])"
  },
